ate": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 2, "runtime_actions": ["blind_retry_malformed"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2", "malformed": true}, {"t_ms": 12130, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01PUVwd7A6cnEsJvAdwC1rqW", "kind": "garbled", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 13813, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) and opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged on-call.\n\n- **Why v2.3.0:** It is the most recent production release marked healthy. v2.3.1 is unhealthy, and v2.2.9 is older.\n- **Result:** checkout-api is healthy on v2.3.0 in every region, and the error rate dropped from 0.18 to 0.002.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 describes the failure, the rollback, and the post-rollback state. It also notes that v2.3.1 was unhealthy in staging as v2.3.1-rc, and that v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until the failure is investigated.\n\nNo change-manager approval was needed, since the rollback target had already been healthy in production.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01RGtBMKJBnAZu12ydgrm2Gv", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Tno1X3kpey5NYf7Tfjuqhk", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent production release that was healthy is v2.3.0 (seq 1). v2.3.1 (seq 3) is unhealthy, and v2.2.9 is older. Rolling back to v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01T5kK5F1MBL